    "sections": {
        "description": "NAS Grocery and Organic Store is a clean, modern, and lightweight WordPress theme designed specifically for grocery stores, organic food shops, supermarkets, and online daily essentials businesses. Build a professional WooCommerce-powered ecommerce website with ease. Features include dedicated sections for product categories, featured products, special offers, promotional banners, and customer testimonials. The design focuses on clarity, usability, and a familiar retail shopping experience to encourage conversions. Fully WooCommerce-ready with intuitive product catalog, clean product pages, shopping cart, and streamlined checkout process. Efficient inventory management, pricing updates, and product management from WordPress dashboard. 12+ beautiful color variations to match your brand. Fully responsive and mobile-friendly design works seamlessly across all devices. SEO-optimized code structure, fast loading speeds, RTL language support, and translation-ready functionality. Perfect for grocery shops, organic food stores, supermarket websites, and food delivery businesses."
    },
